{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Please describe your character **and post an avatar (40x40 pixels) sized picture that we can use to represent them on maps.** Feel free to include backstory or full sized art too.","created_at":"2021-06-05T18:50:30.965000Z","edited_at":"2021-06-05T18:54:01.792000Z","id":"850808824251023381","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"backupPreview.png","id":"863064956298723358","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863064956298723358-backupPreview.png","message_id":"863064956802433104","sha256":"3d1951813a19b8719db1a676c94540523a635c9e214f7c433cb31e898c341aac","size":616946,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863064956298723358/backupPreview.png?ex=6ac06920&is=6abf17a0&hm=ea25939e44767ad61387387876f1a9af31cf35c7b0630ef65a73aa8b18dc5992&"},{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"rsz_b52981af-47a8-461c-913e-fce2b60a302c.png","id":"863064956600320020","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863064956600320020-rsz_b52981af-47a8-461c-913e-fce2b60a302c.png","message_id":"863064956802433104","sha256":"8c888bfd50d44c96be38dcac6901849f588fcb6da1ab671ae55342cb32832ccb","size":5513,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863064956600320020/rsz_b52981af-47a8-461c-913e-fce2b60a302c.png?ex=6ac06920&is=6abf17a0&hm=a1fdcb650b82b182e788c4365b8ff1551d563af6e4612eb234649332a7138e1d&"}],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"**Seraxa** (she/her) is a hexblood warlock. She is of Medium size. She has pale skin, violet eyes, and voluminous white hair. She also has a pair of antlers sprouting out of the sides of her head. She wears a backpack filled with water for her familiar Orphy to stay in, because he's always summoned in aquatic forms.\n\n> Seraxa is the hexblood \"daughter\" of Mother Elizabeth, a night hag who plagued the settlers of Roanoke over a hundred years ago. Seraxa stayed in the Feywild for years, even after the hags had died, and when she finally came out, the world was older and different.\n> \n> She wandered the New World for a while, meeting all sorts of people, until one day she came upon The Swordfish and became a Hexblade warlock. She met her familiar Orphy later. Supposedly, Orphy was the one who whispered in Seraxa's ear to go to Empire City. The truth of this is questionable, but regardless of her reason, Seraxa would be in Empire City.\n\nIrynx Berlio was a sea elf born and raised in the oceans by Arcania. She had accidentally killed a sea hag once and was tricked by the rest of the coven into becoming a hexblood as revenge.","created_at":"2021-07-09T14:32:00.673000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T23:34:26.532000Z","id":"863064956802433104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"e067051b38c9b8cf179109b5a5d8512e.jpg","id":"863157394146328626","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863157394146328626-e067051b38c9b8cf179109b5a5d8512e.jpg","message_id":"863157394367053824","sha256":"3c8ad19faf52b61d54f306968e9a7d84f7bf2d8659a9083764d03d2c6b1dd482","size":89401,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863157394146328626/e067051b38c9b8cf179109b5a5d8512e.jpg?ex=6ac0bf37&is=6abf6db7&hm=345f909d2321daddd29886d6d8d25424c53c04dc5ef85cbe964573fcc5d81db8&"}],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"My family is several generations old. My entire bloodline was curse when an ancestor of mine refused to take in a little old lady. So she cursed so that no matter who, even if a non-tiefling is willing to marry into our family. All the children are born as Tieflings, as a way to humiliate my family name. My mother Melissa Davenport loved to travel all over and she use to tell us stories at bed of her adventures. My father Ernest Davenport was Laborer. Him and I were inseparable. That is until his untimely due to an accident at his work. Poor working condition and cut corners ended with the death of my father. My siblings and I tried to bring to light what happened. We snuck into the area on a rainy and stormy night to find evidence but I was struck by lightning and when I woke up I found I had strength within me that let me push beyond my normal limitations. So I decided I will use my new strength to make sure nothing ever happened to others as it has to me.","created_at":"2021-07-09T20:39:19.506000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T01:08:30.279000Z","id":"863157394367053824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"unknown.png","id":"863159254365241384","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863159254365241384-unknown.png","message_id":"863159254537601044","sha256":"bacd639a578fd413e8a77f3f427723a2dafa0e33c972b333f5f10f2c8161b9a1","size":4910,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863159254365241384/unknown.png?ex=6ac0c0f2&is=6abf6f72&hm=51c36e5c367a2bd1c6b446ba0e5c5c00d6bc2f3a6d1f702033e67ffb85cd2368&"}],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-09T20:46:43.005000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863159254537601044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"39e2556fc4d85d73445f2de54b82206f.png","id":"863220255219646474","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863220255219646474-39e2556fc4d85d73445f2de54b82206f.png","message_id":"863220255455313960","sha256":"20ee00eaf9a51403252c52f4112446f9523294b8c124253d7ac2fcd39f9c0ce3","size":218263,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863220255219646474/39e2556fc4d85d73445f2de54b82206f.png?ex=6ac05102&is=6abeff82&hm=d6b58a6609cc2f91e07235cf539b4270f2c7fdcf6b4b1ee0fbb76a4db747493f&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"The walking ghost of the railroads. the man is rumored to have been a lot of things: enforcer, pirate, hitman. others swear that he's a good man and a hard worker, a fair number of railway men speak highly of him. old bones is a bit of a mystery but you've all probably seen him around town. one of the few in hampstead who seems adamant on staying instead of fleeing into a borough that would be easier living. he occasionally visits the other boroughs but has a focus on his work in hampstead, whatever that might entail. in a fight he's a guardian spellcaster who serves to shield allies and make them perform at greater heights. but you can swear he didn't have his right hand a moment ago.","created_at":"2021-07-10T00:49:06.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863220255455313960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"bones.png","id":"863220325776490516","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863220325776490516-bones.png","message_id":"863220325926961152","sha256":"72ed97dee8f140b163fd9e9275a461eea286b1459486434b7f13bfe8e2d84599","size":18549,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863220325776490516/bones.png?ex=6ac05113&is=6abeff93&hm=2a69d046686f5ab91476563d567805a28cf68075cc91d0882789dd6f07103e36&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-10T00:49:23.559000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863220325926961152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"Screenshot_2021-05-28-01-48-473.png","id":"863265852119187476","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863265852119187476-Screenshot_2021-05-28-01-48-473.png","message_id":"863265852501393468","sha256":"b3cb6e8f7d333aec9b26dfb861327f7292a13490cd2eef24d057beb557cb5fc6","size":1101944,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863265852119187476/Screenshot_2021-05-28-01-48-473.png?ex=6ac07b79&is=6abf29f9&hm=a468f1c316c45735c1207ad4fa085bec04179c9a43fea3790ec9ca96f5846251&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Bo walks the streets with wonder, the towering buildings reaching higher than the trees back home. His faded and worn clothes are well weathered. As he lightly walks down the streets, the banjo he plays echoes through the crowd. A few odd looks here and there are directed towards him, towards his simple look. A look not seen in the city too often, his straw hat in desperate need of repairs. He hasn't a care in the world... He is here to play. Coming to the big city to seek out musical fame. To hear stories of great adventures. And to possibly carve out an adventure of his own. A group of onlookers nearby giggle at him, his appearance more comical than he anticipated. Tipping his hat towards the small group, he smiles. \"Howdy! The name's Cap'n Bo Harkness.\" He winks and smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-10T03:50:17.940000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863265852501393468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"unknown-1.png","id":"863265861901090866","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863265861901090866-unknown-1.png","message_id":"863265862046449705","sha256":"75126c6aab39be0417c8f93953c27bfa5046f46b518c4e8b7cfe45c2dae2b2b7","size":5469,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863265861901090866/unknown-1.png?ex=6ac07b7c&is=6abf29fc&hm=c41fdc0e35a4d0d2d1e8d2605c740ee9e5e03cd90dd0a8b0544f8c9009956ce1&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-10T03:50:20.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863265862046449705","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"Roy_screenshot_2a.png","id":"863287394617917460","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863287394617917460-Roy_screenshot_2a.png","message_id":"863287394907717672","sha256":"897fd4e79ab53f26ce38ec21b7db3c7c57cec4709c5e57c84a5cf4ef68f31325","size":1521839,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863287394617917460/Roy_screenshot_2a.png?ex=6ac08f89&is=6abf3e09&hm=f99f6447728d92a631aea4098cce276c95255a595b221caa5ac96ae84f68a777&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"<https://www.dndbeyond.com/characters/51194492>\nYou may have noticed this guy hanging out by the ports. But likely not due to his relative shortness, or light tan, or the overalls with makeshift pockets sewn onto them, possibly not even that some started calling him the \"night *shifter*\" after his working hours - the first thing you might notice could very well be the odd buzzing sound that seems to accompany him every now and then.\n\nIf you stop by to talk with him between repairs and other work, you might hear about his hometown in central Europe, where people live in symbiosis with insects that help them in various ways. You might get half-jokingly recruited to join the swarm's new branch in Arcania, which he was sent here to establish a foothold for, but don't worry about it - typically the more details one hears, the more they tend to want to end the topic, so you wouldn't be the only one to pass on the offer. You might also hear something about his work as a mechanic, if you manage to steer the conversation somewhere you don't hear the word \"swarm\" more often in a sentence than you did the entire last year.\nBut, if you're curious enough, you could learn more about the teamwork of millions of tiny critters and one carrying them around from Roy the night shifter. As long as you let him finish his repairs.","created_at":"2021-07-10T05:15:54.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863287394907717672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"roy_40x40.png","id":"863287433592569856","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863287433592569856-roy_40x40.png","message_id":"863287433776463893","sha256":"96732e86ca82039922a31e2eb7a9dad506c123d7c266d38a754205ca8c897889","size":4211,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863287433592569856/roy_40x40.png?ex=6ac08f93&is=6abf3e13&hm=190dd545e0f26754767f9804f819828d2685451941e4086c21b5af3db41c7c16&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-10T05:16:03.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863287433776463893","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
