{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"190588_l1enFX83-1.png","id":"863436064320782356","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863436064320782356-190588_l1enFX83-1.png","message_id":"863436064941015090","sha256":"0e1b11a07aa444f63bb2b2f6aa779f219a9d59352ad6eb3777ee0dd998369cc6","size":358429,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863436064320782356/190588_l1enFX83-1.png?ex=6ac0713f&is=6abf1fbf&hm=6f2f7c91f0fdd9599623cb5b682f5581fce5ae99c8781c198f5880991d7f20a5&"},{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"701767_qGNluejs-1.png","id":"863436064592232471","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863436064592232471-701767_qGNluejs-1.png","message_id":"863436064941015090","sha256":"7b6fe34c1f25eee5aceaa53502c10b2e39b600e4c65c1ef86f06de744a6ab3ea","size":312008,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863436064592232471/701767_qGNluejs-1.png?ex=6ac0713f&is=6abf1fbf&hm=6dc9186bfb0f4368fc0fadde1d7d9a1d1d0bb1652aaea82eceb1e22977987a73&"},{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"20210709_121259.png","id":"863436064810467399","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863436064810467399-20210709_121259.png","message_id":"863436064941015090","sha256":"8c23b50b6691d78c5a2105b9a22a39d388ac2fd9294c325c3fb552625a29cedc","size":9433,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863436064810467399/20210709_121259.png?ex=6ac0713f&is=6abf1fbf&hm=0607d28691d2e289b3ec4f3a631f08e05e6972c03ca62163110ac30a2ad016c3&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Eliot, is a slim young man with mint green hair pulled back into a ponytail and violet eyes. He's constantly dressing formally, particuly a dress shirt and vest. He came to Empire City to fulfill his dream of running a cafe. Upon opening he realized he would be incapable of running it on his own. So he talked with stray animals, offering them a place to sleep and food to eat for a little bit of help. He renamed the cafe two months after opening to pay omage to the volunteers and employees. Crepes and Crits Cafè.\n\nHe's often seen at his cafe or going to and from fetching supplies. He's typically accompanied by various animals assisting him in tasks or helping out at the cafè. \n\nHe's still an inexperienced business owner, but he's trying his best to satisfy anyone who walks through his doors.","created_at":"2021-07-10T15:06:39.748000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T15:08:56.802000Z","id":"863436064941015090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"image0.png","id":"863469130542481418","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863469130542481418-image0.png","message_id":"863469130857185331","sha256":"cb42d8c9fe1fd3ba4124472837ca30f47986efba04e9d37c12ed998f0f856005","size":259106,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863469130542481418/image0.png?ex=6ac0900b&is=6abf3e8b&hm=f1d0b40c6fd9d4d4fae274417c7b93a888d42d9fa09dda5ccb64bfd822c0e1c9&"}],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Adon Parks is often seen on their way to work at the Bellevue Hospital, where they work as a candy striper. Prior to coming to Empire City, Adon was drafted into a war they never wanted to join as a war nurse, where they learned their craft as a healer (life cleric). \nThey are a short (5’3) satyr with brown fur covering their lower half, and brown floppy hair on their head. They have soft light brown ears and two small cream colored horns. They have green eyes and wear glasses.","created_at":"2021-07-10T17:18:03.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863469130857185331","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
