{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"CairnPortrait.jpg","id":"863478381000785930","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863478381000785930-CairnPortrait.jpg","message_id":"863478381227933776","sha256":"de0b3e1b26fa1e77fa4a850e46c689c6db0cae053054e2c5f26e216b756e4cb9","size":133853,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863478381000785930/CairnPortrait.jpg?ex=6ac098a8&is=6abf4728&hm=276c9c2cd1308581a0cd425d0845e385b99329a7f48095c2e758c71df521b227&"}],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Cairn walks with purpose off of the gang plank of the Peaky Blinders. He tips his hat to the Dockmaster and whispers \"Thanks\" as he hands him a sealed envelope.Cairn's walking cane taps the side of the skiff. \"Take care of 'er. She's all I got these days.\" He begins to walk into the city heading for the City.","created_at":"2021-07-10T17:54:48.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863478381227933776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"Cairn_ThumbToken.jpg","id":"863478687039357038","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863478687039357038-Cairn_ThumbToken.jpg","message_id":"863478686812209203","sha256":"d86a0cc9f815b2c3b391b9b269980f42f669dbe16277b540dac68d1fec45042f","size":3117,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863478687039357038/Cairn_ThumbToken.jpg?ex=6ac098f1&is=6abf4771&hm=c4dc5cb00dfef95813cdd055b277c192e95ebb66e6ffb16e00c3c97796187292&"}],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-10T17:56:01.594000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863478686812209203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"**Edward 'Ed' Harkness**\n\n**Physical description**\nFrom behind a barrel, in the dark... two bright blue eyes can be seen before the small round face of a young jackalope is seen. Once they are sure that no one has followed them to this place and all trouble is over, they gets up and casually brushes the dust off their light blue coat clashing with their light brown fur. \nWhen you see them clearly, you can also tell that they're a rather rotund and friendly jackalope. Their expressions often shift from mischievous to dramatic, and can at times be over the top because of their desire to some day be a known actor in a mayor play. \n\n**Backstory**\nAfter hiding in a ship and being found as a stowaway on the Kilvacan pirate ship, they learned the much needed skills every pirate needs: cleaning and dealing with large pieces of fabric. Eight years later and six months before our adventure begins in Empire City, Ed's ship was detained and ransacked by the Redcoats. They, together with few others, managed to escape imprisonment due to the doubtful origin of the items found in the vessel. After some time of doing odd jobs while looking for their fellow sailors, they were hired to sweep floors by a theater. And it was there that Ed found their inspiration for acting and dancing accompanied by their trusty pan flute. Many, many, many rejections later, they can still be found sweeping floors and helping backstage at the same run-down theater. \n\nhttps://ddb.ac/characters/46356087/kpFwsC","created_at":"2021-07-10T17:56:55.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863478914303262780","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
