{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Rion","id":"710734124935020544","is_bot":0,"username":"rionhozuki"},"author_id":"710734124935020544","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Kaizer Mevous stand at 6’2 ft with a small frame   With a scholars cloak and a bag with his most important books. Always when he’s seen he seems awkward and always try’s his best to avoid eye contact, he has the look of a naive man who’s trying his best to find his answer to his only concerns. \n\n\nBackstory: Kaizer is...was once a researcher in the field of ancient entities mostly demons and other ancient beings, hopefully to expand his mind and improve his life by making a pact with one of these deity’s for him and his younger sister Olivia. As there parents had abandoned them a long time ago now he raised her by himself for about Thirteen years, as they both grew eventually Kaizer found one of these ancient deity that he hopes will help his last remaining family, and just as he was about to succeed with his plan outa the blue when Kaizer returned from a recent visit to the library his sister simply vanished from there home without a trace. For days he looked but to no avail, in pure desperation he called out to any of these powerful beings to grant him knowledge and power for he will sell his soul really anything for the only one who has mattered to him his sister. Eventually something reached out and granted him what he seek’d, as he granted a pact so the Warden Oro became his patron but Kaizer has to be indebted to him until it was settled, Kaizer willingly agreed without a second thought. A year now has passed since his search began in Manhattan, his search continues now, it’s taken Him far now he hopes he is getting closer to figuring out his sister disappearance or has he givens up his soul for nothing...","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:02:37.431000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863495446566797354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
