{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"unknown.png","id":"863497674388537364","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863497674388537364-unknown.png","message_id":"863497674627088444","sha256":"8850fccfb8dde05110f72a0668499a8e819e4d26d9a9ab3d2632da0dc1be7c3c","size":502600,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863497674388537364/unknown.png?ex=6ac0aaa0&is=6abf5920&hm=eb93b2bfaa4d88f196f1d0242a7a241229644cead93d0d1e5723b574046d48b1&"}],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Talia is most often seen with her head down as she sorts her way through the city streets, thoroughly minding her own business; thus is the life of a bootlegger and a smuggler.\nA grim individual who keeps to herself, she sees no time for pleasure nor pleasantry in a world like this one. Victory over tyranny is to be obtained at any cost, and as such, she relentlessly pursues the study of any magic to provide an advantage over the Redcoats, as foul as it may be.","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:11:28.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863497674627088444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
