{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"image0.png","id":"863502416133357638","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863502416133357638-image0.png","message_id":"863502416379641876","sha256":"4c936b4ca66e4a71740500285ecad2f708ad02e8c6c8348f0ff0d861ba0e92a4","size":3182,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863502416133357638/image0.png?ex=6ac0af0b&is=6abf5d8b&hm=bbc6f391dac3943b1d65de4b43ff84dea4bd92e49a1c409588800f92e5ad6e63&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Rion","id":"710734124935020544","is_bot":0,"username":"rionhozuki"},"author_id":"710734124935020544","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:30:19.164000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863502416379641876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"**Description**\nMeorys (she/her) is an Aereni High Elf with medium skin, silver eyes, and violet hair usually done in a neat enough braid. She often takes her coat off, preferring to wrap it in her waist or hang it in the back of her chair.\n\n**Introduction**\n\n“Huh, interesting. Maybe I’ll stick around here for a few decades.”\n\nNo one really heard the elf whisper to herself, concealed as she was in one of the ship’s many masts. No one knows where Meorys came from, either. Just that -in one random day- she was here. Just like the trinkets she trades behind taverns and under tables, she just appeared. \n\nNo one also knows that her eyes-now silver- were once simple black. And *she* doesn’t know that it happened when she picked the plums in an unmarked grave. That when she thought she was bringing home dinner, she also brought the dead with her. Now whispering in her ears, aiding her in the life she’s building in the Empire.","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:35:54.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863503822026440734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
